  m_Name: fireflyadvice
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalEntry
  ID: fireflyadvice
  Logs:
  - 'firefly jeno gave me some advice on tricking with the spectral flame:


    i
    can blast jump by shooting near my feet while jumping. I can wall jump by shooting
    low  while pressing forward. Finally, they told me i can pogo jump by shooting
    before hitting the ground, and to make sure to aim further and further ahead
    as my speed increases. '
